WEBVTT

01:59.080 --> 02:01.120
You can't handle your alcohol. Drink less.

02:03.520 --> 02:04.360
What's really going on?

02:04.440 --> 02:06.200
You called me out so late.

02:26.880 --> 02:33.400
I'm a fickle, heartless jerk.

02:37.280 --> 02:39.120
I actually have feelings for her.

02:51.120 --> 02:54.280
Fang Jin has a high education,
and she likes doing research.

02:54.360 --> 02:56.480
You two must have a lot in common.

02:57.360 --> 02:59.760
Two smart minds are attracted
to each other.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.240
Isn't that normal?

03:09.360 --> 03:16.000
I'm a fickle, heartless jerk.

03:17.400 --> 03:19.160
Not only do I fall for someone else,

03:21.280 --> 03:25.400
but I also go from liking her

03:25.480 --> 03:28.120
to not liking her all the time.

03:29.760 --> 03:34.320
What do you mean by that?

03:40.680 --> 03:41.800
You're hurt.

03:42.760 --> 03:43.720
If you can't walk, I'll carry you.

03:48.520 --> 03:50.000
Sometimes,

03:53.600 --> 03:55.320
I like Fang Jin.

03:59.320 --> 04:02.360
I like her a lot.

04:06.960 --> 04:12.080
My heart races like thump-thump.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.720
I've really fallen for her.

04:25.520 --> 04:27.360
Run, come on. Run now.

04:27.440 --> 04:29.840
Come on. Run.

04:30.720 --> 04:33.240
Run. Where are you running to?

04:35.880 --> 04:37.200
But sometimes,

04:41.040 --> 04:42.720
I don't like Fang Jin,

04:45.000 --> 04:47.840
not at all.

04:52.320 --> 04:55.240
My heart is quiet.

04:57.320 --> 05:02.360
I'm very calm.

05:05.040 --> 05:08.760
It's like…

05:10.320 --> 05:11.200
Like what?

05:11.800 --> 05:16.720
Like the feeling when facing a stranger.

05:20.640 --> 05:21.600
Do you think

05:24.920 --> 05:31.880
I'm an unmatched, heartless jerk?

05:52.640 --> 05:53.560
Come on. Calm down.

05:57.200 --> 05:58.240
Cheers.

06:31.360 --> 06:32.960
The filter is being upgraded,

06:33.520 --> 06:35.520
so you're stuck with my appearance?

06:38.880 --> 06:41.360
This technology seems unstable.

06:42.960 --> 06:44.120
Sorry.

06:44.200 --> 06:46.720
I didn't expect
that it'd cause you inconvenience.

06:46.800 --> 06:49.080
Once the filter returns to normal,

06:49.160 --> 06:50.280
I promise I'll go back to being myself.

06:51.640 --> 06:53.080
You're just trying to help me,

06:53.160 --> 06:55.680
so you're stuck in this dilemma.

06:57.720 --> 07:00.080
I've caused you so much trouble.

07:00.720 --> 07:02.360
I should be the one apologizing.

07:02.440 --> 07:03.760
No, no.

07:04.280 --> 07:05.480
Thank you.

07:09.320 --> 07:10.440
Qingli,

07:16.160 --> 07:17.320
I'm glad you're here.

07:18.800 --> 07:21.200
Otherwise, I wouldn't know what to do.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.640
Without me,

07:25.720 --> 07:28.240
you're still the respected Dr. Fang.

07:28.920 --> 07:31.600
Guan Shengyu can take your company
and your marriage,

07:31.680 --> 07:34.720
but he can't take your knowledge
and your wisdom.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.680
Guan Shengyu has met me.

07:38.760 --> 07:40.960
He'll never take advantage of you.

07:42.840 --> 07:45.600
I'll help you protect
your company and money.

07:48.120 --> 07:50.000
I only want a divorce

07:50.840 --> 07:52.280
to be away from Guan Shengyu.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.680
Nothing else matters.

07:55.280 --> 07:57.720
How can you say that?

07:58.360 --> 08:00.520
If evil isn't punished,
how can good be promoted?

08:01.160 --> 08:04.280
Guan Shengyu must pay the price
for his actions.

08:18.160 --> 08:20.240
Mistakes happen
even in scientific experiments

08:20.320 --> 08:21.760
controlled precisely,

08:22.560 --> 08:24.840
let alone in our unpredictable lives.

08:28.640 --> 08:31.520
Guan Shengyu is just a mistake.
We can correct it.

08:36.000 --> 08:39.640
Fang Jin, during this time,
feel free to stay at my place.

08:39.720 --> 08:40.840
With Chengcheng around,

08:40.919 --> 08:42.559
Guan Shengyu won't dare harass you.

08:43.919 --> 08:45.520
If he comes, I'll hit him.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.440
No wonder Guan Shengyu
always says I hit him.

08:57.920 --> 08:59.160
As it turns out, it's you.

09:05.720 --> 09:08.080
Good job. Thank you.

09:17.440 --> 09:18.760
To summarize,

09:18.840 --> 09:23.240
according to Articles 1079 and 1091

09:23.320 --> 09:25.360
of the PRC Civil Code,

09:25.440 --> 09:26.720
the court decides.

09:26.800 --> 09:29.120
First, the plaintiff, Fang Jin,

09:29.200 --> 09:31.000
shall divorce the defendant.

09:31.080 --> 09:34.960
Second, the defendant, Guan Shengyu,
shall pay the plaintiff, Fang Jin,

09:35.040 --> 09:37.200
mental compensation of 50,000 yuan
within five days

09:37.280 --> 09:39.200
from the effective date of this judgment.

09:39.280 --> 09:41.320
Third, the plaintiff, Fang Jin,

09:41.400 --> 09:44.720
is the founder and actual controller
of Xinnan Technology Co. Ltd.

09:44.800 --> 09:46.240
Fang Jin. Fang Jin.

09:47.360 --> 09:48.520
What do you want?

09:49.200 --> 09:51.520
Fang Jin, I'm sorry.

09:51.600 --> 09:52.880
I made a momentary lapse.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.440
Please give me another chance.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.360
Let's start over, okay?

10:01.240 --> 10:03.400
Have you forgotten the happy days we had?

10:04.040 --> 10:06.440
We didn't have money back then,

10:06.520 --> 10:08.560
but we were so happy.

10:12.320 --> 10:14.560
Let's remarry. I swear.

10:14.640 --> 10:16.440
I'll treat you just like I did before.

10:16.520 --> 10:18.960
Let's live a good life, okay?

10:19.560 --> 10:21.080
You've already divorced.

10:21.160 --> 10:23.320
If you dare harass Fang Jin again,
I'll call the police.

10:23.400 --> 10:26.920
- Fang Jin, we had feelings for each other.
- What do you want?

10:27.000 --> 10:28.240
I'm talking to her. Get out of my way.

10:28.320 --> 10:29.640
- Move.
- Guan Shengyu.

10:29.720 --> 10:30.560
- Move.
- Qingli, Qingli.

10:37.280 --> 10:39.120
I knew you wouldn't forget the good times.

10:39.200 --> 10:40.080
Thank you.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.320
Guan Shengyu,

10:46.640 --> 10:48.920
I haven't forgotten the past.

10:49.000 --> 10:50.560
I remember clearly

10:51.480 --> 10:54.280
how you treated me

10:55.640 --> 10:57.320
every day, every moment.

10:59.960 --> 11:01.520
Not only can't I forget now,

11:02.200 --> 11:04.160
but I'll never forget in my whole life.

11:13.440 --> 11:14.440
From today on,

11:17.240 --> 11:19.000
you have nothing to do with me.

11:22.280 --> 11:23.360
Let's go.

11:39.840 --> 11:42.680
HAPPY DIVORCE

11:53.600 --> 11:56.360
Don't worry. It'll be upgraded soon.

11:56.440 --> 11:58.240
I'm okay.

11:58.320 --> 11:59.920
It's not my first time.

12:00.000 --> 12:03.800
But I feel bad for Fang Jin,
walking around with her face.

12:06.680 --> 12:08.000
Qingli and Fang Jin are back.

12:08.080 --> 12:10.200
Where's my microphone?

12:15.000 --> 12:17.240
Dr. Fang, hello.

12:17.320 --> 12:19.960
Congrats on your divorce.

12:20.040 --> 12:20.880
Why are you here?

12:22.880 --> 12:24.480
I heard Dr. Fang's lawsuit is over.

12:24.560 --> 12:26.000
I came to visit on behalf of the company.

12:26.760 --> 12:28.520
I wanted to come earlier
to show my sincerity,

12:29.120 --> 12:30.000
but you were back before I got here.

12:31.160 --> 12:33.120
Dr. Fang, hello. I'm Gu Yu from TBC.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.400
You're just in time.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.080
Check out the character design
for the first unit.

12:44.600 --> 12:46.840
- Now?
- Yes.

12:46.920 --> 12:48.560
My creative enthusiasm is uncontrollable.

12:48.640 --> 12:50.200
I must discuss it with you now.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.240
Here, here.

12:59.440 --> 13:00.280
Here.

13:00.880 --> 13:01.920
Sit down and look.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.880
Take a good look.

13:14.360 --> 13:16.440
Congrats on your divorce.

13:33.280 --> 13:34.800
Why are you hiding here?

13:37.440 --> 13:40.680
Gu Yu's in the studio.
He's here for Fang Jin.

13:42.760 --> 13:44.080
You'd better hide well.

13:44.160 --> 13:45.520
I'll handle the rest.

13:45.600 --> 13:48.240
Fang Jin, congrats on your divorce.

14:03.720 --> 14:05.200
How about I…

14:09.080 --> 14:11.000
I should go home and think about it.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.800
When I have a clearer idea,
I'll discuss it with you.

14:22.160 --> 14:24.160
Why not look at the turtle I raised?

14:29.480 --> 14:31.600
Come on, come on. Come on.

14:34.640 --> 14:35.680
Squat and watch.

14:38.000 --> 14:40.320
This is called the lucky turtle.

14:40.400 --> 14:41.480
It's from Changbai Mountain,

14:41.560 --> 14:43.560
raised by Master Tao Guang.

14:44.240 --> 14:46.680
It's psychic and can bring good luck.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.200
My lucky turtle is special.

14:49.280 --> 14:50.840
It chose me as its owner.

14:54.200 --> 14:55.280
Master Tao Guang?

14:56.520 --> 14:58.480
I think I have one too.

14:58.560 --> 15:00.360
We must've bought it from the same person.

15:02.600 --> 15:04.880
My lucky turtle chose me as its owner.

15:04.960 --> 15:06.200
I bought mine for 200 yuan.

15:06.280 --> 15:08.480
You must've bought yours for 600 yuan.

15:11.160 --> 15:13.440
You're definitely luckier than I am.

15:15.160 --> 15:16.240
I knew it.

15:16.320 --> 15:18.120
I'm the lady of destiny.

15:19.040 --> 15:21.120
Lin Yuan will get rich soon.

15:53.120 --> 15:54.960
Come and see my books.

16:00.280 --> 16:01.880
These are all my books.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.920
Take your time. Start with this one.

16:07.040 --> 16:09.720
Lin Yuan, we're back.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.480
Stop looking. Let's go.

16:17.920 --> 16:20.640
Dr. Fang, we hope you can consider us

16:20.720 --> 16:22.720
for the patent of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

16:22.800 --> 16:24.280
Of course, we welcome you

16:24.360 --> 16:26.040
to visit our company anytime
to learn about us

16:26.120 --> 16:27.080
and evaluate our company.

16:33.040 --> 16:35.840
Thank you. I will seriously consider it

16:35.920 --> 16:37.840
and reply to you as soon as possible.

16:39.280 --> 16:40.400
Good.

16:40.480 --> 16:42.160
Looking forward to your reply.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.240
I won't interrupt your celebration.

16:47.960 --> 16:49.280
Sincere congratulations on your divorce.

16:50.520 --> 16:51.480
Thank you.

17:01.800 --> 17:03.760
PARTY A: ZHOU JINLI

17:22.760 --> 17:25.319
PARTY B: FANG JIN

17:37.120 --> 17:38.200
Here.

17:41.880 --> 17:44.480
Ms. Fang, I didn't expect you
to decide so quickly.

17:45.680 --> 17:47.640
Thank you for your trust in us.

17:49.440 --> 17:50.840
Thank you.

17:52.840 --> 17:54.080
Ms. Fang, please sit.

17:56.760 --> 17:59.280
If there's anything you need,
feel free to ask.

18:03.120 --> 18:05.160
The reason I decided it so quickly

18:05.240 --> 18:08.520
is that after interacting
with your staff recently,

18:09.280 --> 18:12.320
I found you serious and responsible.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.400
Tang Qi is always serious and responsible.

18:15.480 --> 18:17.880
He was supposed to be here today,

18:17.960 --> 18:20.000
but he's a bit unwell,
so he couldn't make it.

18:23.440 --> 18:25.240
Dr. Fang isn't talking about Tang Qi?

18:26.680 --> 18:29.760
I'm talking about Su Chengcheng.

18:30.840 --> 18:33.720
Your company's Su Chengcheng
has helped me a lot.

18:33.800 --> 18:35.280
You mean Su Chengcheng?

18:37.720 --> 18:39.000
Why not call Chengcheng over

18:39.080 --> 18:41.440
and let her meet Ms. Fang?

18:41.520 --> 18:43.760
Su Chengcheng is on sick leave.

18:45.800 --> 18:48.720
Su Chengcheng is sick because of me.

18:49.600 --> 18:51.200
Please don't blame her.

18:51.280 --> 18:53.000
Dr. Fang, don't worry.

18:53.080 --> 18:54.160
For the Marketing Department,

18:54.240 --> 18:58.280
we care more about the actual results
than attendance.

18:59.960 --> 19:01.080
That's good.

19:01.160 --> 19:03.920
Tomorrow, our company
will hold an online product launch event.

19:04.000 --> 19:06.720
I'd like to invite Ms. Fang
as a special guest.

19:10.280 --> 19:11.440
I can't.

19:12.160 --> 19:14.800
Ms. Fang has time.
She'll definitely attend.

19:16.240 --> 19:18.400
I still have work to do.

19:19.760 --> 19:21.360
You can go back to the lab now.

19:21.440 --> 19:24.800
We'll discuss the event
once you're done at the lab.

19:32.240 --> 19:34.200
Alright, it's settled then.

19:35.360 --> 19:37.120
Looking forward to your visit.

19:41.400 --> 19:42.720
I'll walk Ms. Fang out.

19:44.080 --> 19:46.000
This way.

19:46.080 --> 19:46.920
Thank you.

19:57.240 --> 19:58.440
Mr. Zhou, please stay.

19:58.520 --> 20:01.240
Thank you for agreeing
to cooperate with us.

20:03.800 --> 20:04.800
I…

20:08.960 --> 20:10.080
You…

20:12.280 --> 20:13.600
It's just…

20:13.680 --> 20:15.960
My pleasure. It's nothing.

20:20.520 --> 20:21.360
Let's go.

20:51.760 --> 20:52.920
Please come in.

20:55.960 --> 20:57.280
Dr. Fang has left.

20:57.800 --> 20:59.760
You can feel better now.

21:00.720 --> 21:02.680
Has the packaging design
for the air cushion been decided?

21:02.760 --> 21:04.480
We're in a rush for the final plan.

21:04.560 --> 21:06.600
This packaging must be
aesthetically pleasing

21:06.680 --> 21:08.440
and compensate for the imperfections,

21:09.240 --> 21:11.960
increasing the sealability
to lock in moisture.

21:12.040 --> 21:14.040
I'm afraid I missed something.

21:14.920 --> 21:17.240
You want to confirm the final design
with Fang Jin?

21:27.200 --> 21:30.000
Dr. Fang is divorced, and you're single.

21:30.080 --> 21:31.400
Why can't you spend more time with her?

21:35.960 --> 21:36.800
But I…

21:45.120 --> 21:46.000
I don't know.

21:56.720 --> 22:00.000
Are you afraid of meeting
the Fang Jin you like

22:00.680 --> 22:02.480
or the one you don't like?

22:07.160 --> 22:09.640
Sometimes, when things are unclear,

22:09.720 --> 22:13.160
it's better to set them aside for now
and leave it to time.

22:13.840 --> 22:16.200
For adults, feelings and work

22:17.040 --> 22:17.880
are two different things.

22:19.440 --> 22:20.560
You're right.

22:28.200 --> 22:30.080
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?

22:35.160 --> 22:36.280
I'm going to find Fang Jin now.

22:41.400 --> 22:45.000
The test data shows
this fine and elastic mesh design

22:45.080 --> 22:47.280
with a polyester spandex outer layer

22:47.360 --> 22:49.920
and a nylon spandex mesh inner layer

22:50.000 --> 22:53.240
can lock in the lipophilic small molecules
in the powder,

22:53.320 --> 22:55.800
reduce exposure to air,
balance out oxidation,

22:55.880 --> 22:57.960
seal in moisture, and maintain hydration.

22:58.040 --> 23:00.960
The effect three months after opening
will be the same

23:01.040 --> 23:02.920
as when it was first opened.

23:03.000 --> 23:04.400
Fang Jin,

23:04.480 --> 23:06.560
your brain is just amazing.

23:06.640 --> 23:08.400
You can solve any problem.

23:09.120 --> 23:10.440
It's your attention to detail,

23:10.520 --> 23:13.360
considering the product's defects
after opening,

23:13.440 --> 23:16.440
that gave me the chance
to think of a way to remedy it.

23:17.880 --> 23:21.480
I only raise problems
but can't solve them.

23:21.560 --> 23:24.280
Only by noticing problems
can we solve them.

23:25.600 --> 23:28.440
It's like we're complimenting ourselves.

23:30.160 --> 23:31.800
You're just like me.

23:39.760 --> 23:41.160
Do we look like a real celebrity

23:41.240 --> 23:44.040
and her wax figure taking a photo?

23:50.280 --> 23:53.080
Mr. Tang is calling you.

23:53.160 --> 23:54.520
It must be about work.

23:55.720 --> 23:57.520
Is it the man I met at the factory?

23:58.600 --> 24:01.640
Mr. Zhou said he wasn't feeling well.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.960
Did he get injured that night?

24:13.240 --> 24:14.960
Tang Qi wants to discuss work.

24:15.040 --> 24:16.800
He's at the door.

24:37.600 --> 24:38.680
Please come in.

24:50.800 --> 24:52.040
Working overtime alone?

24:53.400 --> 24:55.840
Yeah, just me working overtime.

24:57.560 --> 24:58.560
Are you afraid of meeting

24:59.600 --> 25:01.160
the Fang Jin you like

25:01.680 --> 25:03.840
or the one you don't like?

25:09.480 --> 25:10.320
The one I don't like.

25:11.080 --> 25:12.120
What did you say?

25:14.280 --> 25:17.320
Regarding the elastic mesh defect
you raised last time,

25:17.400 --> 25:20.000
we've tried special packaging,

25:20.080 --> 25:21.760
but I'm not sure which option is the best,

25:21.840 --> 25:23.400
so I'd like to discuss it with you.

25:34.000 --> 25:35.840
You and Su Chengcheng are in sync.

25:36.440 --> 25:38.760
She's been discussing this
with me all day.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.600
We just did the testing.

25:41.280 --> 25:43.120
Isn't Su Chengcheng sick?

25:46.240 --> 25:47.960
I misspoke.

25:48.040 --> 25:49.560
I did the test just now.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.920
Su Chengcheng is at home resting.

25:51.000 --> 25:53.080
We discussed it over the phone.

25:53.160 --> 25:56.200
These are the test data
for the different options.

25:56.280 --> 25:58.160
Take a look at it.

26:03.160 --> 26:04.040
Great.

26:04.800 --> 26:06.440
I'll send it to Gu Yu right now.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.560
Su Chengcheng already sent it.

26:14.800 --> 26:15.640
Thank you.

26:22.120 --> 26:23.440
- I'll leave you to work.
- Alright.

26:43.000 --> 26:44.240
Who's hiding in there?

26:46.000 --> 26:49.080
- A mouse. It must be a mouse.
- A mouse?

26:55.120 --> 26:57.400
Guan Shengyu tried to frame you before.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.600
I'm worried he won't give up

27:01.200 --> 27:02.600
and is plotting something again.

27:05.480 --> 27:06.800
Fang… Fang Jin.

27:16.640 --> 27:18.280
It's a wax figure.

27:20.160 --> 27:21.000
A wax figure?

27:22.480 --> 27:24.160
Yes, it's a wax figure.

27:24.240 --> 27:26.880
A friend who makes wax figures
gave it to me as a gift.

27:26.960 --> 27:29.160
She was worried that I'd feel lonely
after my divorce,

27:29.240 --> 27:30.640
so she gave it to me to keep me company.

27:38.320 --> 27:41.560
This is so lifelike.

27:51.560 --> 27:53.520
She looks a bit different.

28:03.720 --> 28:06.640
Why are you touching me?

28:09.120 --> 28:10.280
No, no, no.

28:11.720 --> 28:13.760
Sorry, I…

28:15.120 --> 28:17.080
I should go.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.680
My materials…

28:26.480 --> 28:27.720
Sorry, I'll pick them up.

28:53.040 --> 28:54.600
When the power went out that day,

28:54.680 --> 28:56.040
we were eating takeout in the lab.

28:57.680 --> 28:59.600
Do you remember your favorite dish?

28:59.680 --> 29:01.000
What is it?

29:03.880 --> 29:05.320
Is it beef tendon?

29:06.240 --> 29:07.360
Yes.

29:07.440 --> 29:09.440
I remember you said
beef tendon was your favorite.

29:12.680 --> 29:15.440
Dr. Fang is divorced, and you're single.

29:15.520 --> 29:17.440
Why can't you spend more time with her?

29:21.000 --> 29:24.800
That restaurant has recently introduced
a new way of preparing beef tendon.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.400
You'll definitely like it.

29:33.880 --> 29:34.800
Well…

29:40.560 --> 29:43.280
Are you free tonight?

29:44.800 --> 29:46.400
I don't like beef tendon.

29:54.160 --> 29:55.440
I want…

30:11.200 --> 30:12.080
I wanted to know

30:12.160 --> 30:14.680
how the cabinet door
opened and closed by itself,

30:15.640 --> 30:17.400
so I moved the wax figure out

30:17.480 --> 30:19.800
and got inside to check.

30:38.240 --> 30:40.640
- Let's go.
- Go?

30:40.720 --> 30:43.240
Aren't you treating me to dinner?
I have time.

30:43.920 --> 30:45.160
Let's go.

30:59.680 --> 31:01.200
That wax figure…

31:02.720 --> 31:04.200
I'm right here in front of you.

31:04.280 --> 31:06.200
Why are you still thinking
about that wax figure?

31:19.000 --> 31:22.040
Fang Jin's glasses prescription
is so high.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.200
Aren't we taking a car?

31:27.480 --> 31:29.000
That restaurant is nearby.

31:29.080 --> 31:30.640
It's more convenient to walk.

31:41.920 --> 31:43.720
- Thank you.
- Are you okay?

31:46.000 --> 31:46.840
I'm fine.

31:54.800 --> 31:55.920
The one I like.

31:58.320 --> 31:59.360
What do you mean?

32:04.760 --> 32:06.040
The restaurant I like.

32:07.400 --> 32:09.480
I mean the restaurant we're going to

32:10.080 --> 32:11.360
is the one I like.

32:12.000 --> 32:12.920
You scared me.

32:13.000 --> 32:14.920
I thought you were saying you liked me.

32:22.400 --> 32:23.560
Do you know?

32:24.240 --> 32:25.960
Even if it's the same world,

32:26.480 --> 32:28.720
it feels like we're in different worlds

32:29.400 --> 32:32.160
because of different eyes.

32:37.160 --> 32:38.200
Do you believe it?

32:38.880 --> 32:41.280
Even if we walk in the same world,

32:42.040 --> 32:44.040
we don't see the same world.

32:45.400 --> 32:46.600
I believe it.

32:49.440 --> 32:51.400
There's nothing I believe more than this.

32:53.080 --> 32:55.760
I'm curious. What do I look like

32:55.840 --> 32:57.360
in your world?

32:57.440 --> 32:59.560
Will I look better than the real me?

33:06.920 --> 33:09.200
Tang Qi being a tetrachromat is a secret.

33:09.280 --> 33:10.600
Fang Jin doesn't know this.

33:12.800 --> 33:14.680
So, do you want to know

33:15.480 --> 33:18.040
what you look like in my world?

33:20.480 --> 33:21.440
What do I look like?

33:23.840 --> 33:26.360
Sometimes blurry, sometimes clear.

33:27.680 --> 33:29.040
The more I want to see clearly,

33:29.120 --> 33:30.840
the less I can.

33:38.160 --> 33:39.640
Are you feeling unwell?

33:43.560 --> 33:45.720
No. I'm just a bit dizzy.

33:47.160 --> 33:49.320
I think my lenses aren't quite right.

33:49.400 --> 33:50.480
I'll have to go for another eye exam.

33:52.880 --> 33:56.480
So, will you be okay without the glasses?

33:56.560 --> 33:57.680
Can you see clearly?

33:57.760 --> 33:59.920
It's fine. I can see clearly.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.120
Very clearly.

34:13.920 --> 34:16.639
The way Tang Qi looks at me…

34:19.520 --> 34:22.679
I just remembered I have to go,

34:22.760 --> 34:24.320
so I can't have dinner with you.

34:24.400 --> 34:25.800
I'll leave now.

34:25.880 --> 34:28.800
DIDI RIDE-HAILING

34:56.600 --> 34:59.640
They look exactly the same.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.880
One female and one male.

35:02.480 --> 35:04.120
If you look closely, they're not the same.

35:06.920 --> 35:08.440
Your turtle is female,

35:08.520 --> 35:10.560
and mine is male.

35:10.640 --> 35:11.680
If you flip them over,

35:11.760 --> 35:14.800
you'll see the female's plastron is flat,
with no indentation in the center,

35:14.880 --> 35:17.840
while the male's plastron
is slightly concave in the center.

35:22.680 --> 35:23.640
Hello. Your dishes.

35:24.520 --> 35:25.360
Thank you.

35:25.440 --> 35:26.560
Enjoy your meal.

35:30.000 --> 35:31.640
There should be more obvious differences.

35:31.720 --> 35:33.640
Let's eat. We'll talk after the meal.

35:34.800 --> 35:37.280
Talking halfway will spoil my appetite.

35:46.480 --> 35:49.600
The female's cloacal vent is closer
to the back edge of the plastron.

35:49.680 --> 35:52.400
The notch formed by the two anal shields
on the plastron is shallow,

35:52.480 --> 35:53.880
with a larger angle.

35:54.480 --> 35:57.600
The male's cloacal vent is farther
from the back edge of the plastron.

35:57.680 --> 36:00.080
The notch formed
by the two anal shields is deeper,

36:00.760 --> 36:02.080
with a smaller angle.

36:04.760 --> 36:05.840
I knew it.

36:05.920 --> 36:07.600
There are definitely
more obvious differences.

36:10.400 --> 36:11.280
That's chili…

36:12.840 --> 36:13.840
peppers.

36:15.920 --> 36:17.800
My dad is from Sichuan.

36:30.480 --> 36:33.280
What kind of devil chili is this?

36:34.760 --> 36:37.000
South America
is the origin of chili peppers.

36:37.080 --> 36:39.560
The chilies from Sichuan
must call this one "Grandfather".

36:40.480 --> 36:43.120
That's not enough.
They should call it "Forefather".

36:46.520 --> 36:47.680
That's alcohol.

36:48.400 --> 36:49.800
Alcohol…

36:51.560 --> 36:52.960
It's even spicier.

36:54.760 --> 36:56.880
Stop laughing. I'm suffering!

37:05.840 --> 37:06.760
UPGRADING

37:56.200 --> 37:57.720
Don't worry.

37:57.800 --> 38:00.160
The reason why it's slower than last time

38:00.240 --> 38:02.880
must be that the filter
will be more powerful,

38:02.960 --> 38:04.320
so it needs more time.

38:06.600 --> 38:07.720
I hope so.

38:14.560 --> 38:16.680
Something's wrong with you.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.480
What happened?

38:22.480 --> 38:23.640
I think…

38:27.840 --> 38:28.680
It's nothing.

38:29.920 --> 38:31.440
What's going on?

38:32.800 --> 38:34.640
Maybe it's just my illusion.

38:35.360 --> 38:37.520
Say anything. I'll just listen.
I won't take it seriously.

38:38.120 --> 38:38.960
Tell me.

38:41.160 --> 38:45.000
I think Tang Qi seems to like Fang…

39:31.880 --> 39:33.040
Is it okay for me

39:35.760 --> 39:36.960
to dress like this?

39:37.600 --> 39:39.880
Yes, it's very okay.

39:39.960 --> 39:40.800
Of course.

39:40.880 --> 39:42.440
You're so pretty.

39:50.280 --> 39:52.880
No need.
I took Fang Jin to get contact lenses.

39:55.560 --> 39:57.560
I've been so used to wearing glasses.

39:58.800 --> 39:59.640
Not wearing them

40:00.840 --> 40:02.240
feels a bit strange.

40:02.880 --> 40:04.520
Fang Jin's eyes are really beautiful.

40:04.600 --> 40:05.640
You should show them more often.

40:08.480 --> 40:09.960
You're my friends,

40:10.480 --> 40:12.000
so, of course, you think I'm pretty.

40:13.360 --> 40:14.520
Not just us.

40:14.600 --> 40:17.520
You're also beautiful in others' eyes.

40:24.960 --> 40:27.000
You should attend the press conference
tomorrow like this.

40:29.200 --> 40:31.560
In the past, Guan Shengyu

40:31.640 --> 40:33.880
handled these public matters.

40:33.960 --> 40:35.560
I don't have any experience.

40:36.480 --> 40:37.480
Qingli,

40:38.000 --> 40:41.040
maybe I shouldn't go.

40:41.120 --> 40:45.600
No, you must prove to your employees
and your clients

40:45.680 --> 40:46.880
that Xinnan Technology

40:46.960 --> 40:49.000
will operate as usual
without Guan Shengyu.

40:50.000 --> 40:51.320
Fang Jin,

40:51.400 --> 40:53.000
don't you want to start anew

40:53.080 --> 40:54.840
after leaving Guan Shengyu?

40:54.920 --> 40:56.600
This is your new start, your new life.

40:57.920 --> 40:58.960
But

40:59.640 --> 41:02.480
I'm really not good at socializing.

41:03.960 --> 41:05.680
I get nervous

41:07.880 --> 41:09.160
speaking in public.

41:09.760 --> 41:12.320
No one is born used to fighting.

41:12.400 --> 41:14.000
You worked hard for Xinnan Technology.

41:14.080 --> 41:16.280
You must protect it yourself.

41:18.800 --> 41:20.760
The first time I went to court,

41:21.280 --> 41:22.760
I was so nervous
that my legs were trembling.

41:23.640 --> 41:25.880
But after trembling a few times,
it just stopped.

41:28.000 --> 41:29.760
The first time is always the hardest,

41:29.840 --> 41:31.000
but no matter how difficult,

41:31.080 --> 41:34.080
it's easier to rely on yourself
than others.

41:45.040 --> 41:48.160
Fang Jin, you can definitely do it.

41:58.800 --> 42:00.280
Everyone has weaknesses,

42:01.680 --> 42:03.960
but does everyone

42:04.600 --> 42:07.840
must overcome their weaknesses
to live better?
